; status: works — --ac is marked with only a half-diagonal extent (.a to the
; centre .ctr), so its material never reaches .c; folding along it still
; cuts a fresh crease across the WHOLE diagonal, well beyond that marked
; extent ("axiom":"fold" provenance on freshly-cut material that straddles
; past what --ac's own mark ever recorded)
paper square
mark --bd = through .b .d
mark --v = map .a onto .b
.ctr = --bd * --v
mark --ac = through .a .c between .a .ctr
fold --ac moving .b

; assert faces = 2
; assert .ctr paper = (1/2, 1/2)
; assert --ac is valley
